doc episodes 10 Episode 1: "The Main Character" — Bruno Guimaraes steals the show off the pitch.
Cold open: The episode opens on a quiet morning at the training ground.
A day in the life: The camera follows Bruno Guimaraes from the gym at 7am to an evening visit to a local school. Team-mates queue up to tease him in the canteen.
Training ground: A rare clean bill of health for the squad. 
Closing: The season has barely started. Next up: Arsenal Legends (Pre-season friendly) on 8 Aug. The narrator closes the episode: "In this building, there is no such thing as a quiet week." 
QUOTES Ethan Rossi (Kit man (series)): Guimaraes is the first in and the last out. Always asks how my kids are doing.
T (Manager): Players like Guimaraes set the standard. The young lads watch everything he does.
Aaron Pearce (Academy player): The gaffer told me to stay ready. That's all I'm doing, staying ready.
Narrator (Series voice-over): Behind every badge there is a dressing room. Behind every dressing room, a secret.
